  "title": "baton-ramp scoped Ramp Developer API subset",
  "description": "Subset of the Ramp Developer API covering the operations baton-ramp touches for account-creation attributes. Operations and referenced schemas copied verbatim from the official spec; see specs/openapi-provenance.json for the provenance table.",
  "version": "v1"
